1
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,840
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,720
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,080
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,000
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,360
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,440
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,880
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:37,280
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,400
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,680
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:47,080
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:50,320
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,880
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,200
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,360
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:03,520
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:07,000
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:09,920
=Episode 2=

20
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,599
Cheng Mingzhi.

21
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:16,200
You're still alive?

22
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,400
Sorry to disappoint you, Aunt.

23
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,560
Younger Brother, stay still.

24
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:24,200
Move again, and you'll lose your limbs.

25
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:30,760
Aunt, you spoke of burning away evil.

26
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,040
What are you doing?

27
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:37,319
Allow me to cleanse your bad luck, too.

28
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:37,959
You...

29
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,359
Let go of my mother!

30
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:41,319
Let go of me!

31
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,000
Stop.

32
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,680
Let go of me!

33
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Sister!

34
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,400
Help me, sister!

35
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:55,840
Mother.

36
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:59,680
(The Cheng Family's Principal Wife)

37
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:03,079
I'm fine.

38
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:04,040
I'm perfectly fine.

39
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:05,280
Mingzhi.

40
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,520
Mother.

41
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,360
Aunt tried to burn
my principal wife alive.

42
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:11,439
So I dealt with her.

43
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,479
You haven't even wed yet.

44
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,840
What kind of principal wife is that?

45
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,400
Mingzhi.

46
00:02:16,599 --> 00:02:17,599
Be that as it may,

47
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:19,719
she is your elder.

48
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:22,000
You're right, Mother.

49
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,599
Aunt.

50
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,759
If you wish to run this house,

51
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:28,719
I won't stand in your way.

52
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,319
But she was brought here
from the Xia family.

53
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:33,520
She entered our Cheng gates.

54
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:35,639
That makes her mine.

55
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:49,719
Touch her, and you touch me.

56
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:23,039
Army discipline can't go to waste.

57
00:03:26,159 --> 00:03:27,919
You're the Xia family's eldest daughter?

58
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:30,199
I'm the Xia family's second daughter.

59
00:03:30,639 --> 00:03:33,240
My mother, Lady Liu,
was the principal wife.

60
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:37,599
A principal wife's daughter
should have lived in comfort.

61
00:03:37,879 --> 00:03:41,159
(Double Happiness)
Yet you seem to have suffered greatly.

62
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,080
Could it be...

63
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:45,080
Because of your poor eyesight?

64
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,599
I have been blind since childhood.

65
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,960
But compared to having

66
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,560
a vicious concubine made principal wife,

67
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:55,439
my blindness isn't the worst fate.

68
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:57,000
Then you'd better be careful.

69
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:59,520
My family has someone just like that.

70
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,879
Aunt has ruled for over ten years.

71
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:03,439
You humiliated her today.

72
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,759
She won't let this go.

73
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,840
They say you're a dead man walking.

74
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,719
Who wants you dead?

75
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:18,399
I'll find out.

76
00:04:19,759 --> 00:04:21,519
No one guards against a blind woman.

77
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:23,639
I need someone to keep watch on

78
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,079
the dirty secrets in this house.

79
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,439
Of course.

80
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,399
In return,

81
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,560
here in the Cheng house,

82
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,000
I'll do my best to keep you safe.

83
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,079
By the way,

84
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,560
when you were outside earlier,

85
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,560
why didn't you kneel?

86
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,399
Kneel once,

87
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,920
and you'll kneel again.

88
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,000
Kneel to Aunt today,

89
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,399
and tomorrow it'll be someone else.

90
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,879
Kneel too often,
and you'll never rise again.

91
00:05:06,759 --> 00:05:07,560
Father!

92
00:05:14,199 --> 00:05:16,519
Mingzhi, remember this.

93
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:19,199
Never kneel before anyone again.

94
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,000
You may settle in here.

95
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:32,160
I'll be in my study.

96
00:05:33,079 --> 00:05:33,920
Tonight

97
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,439
should be our wedding night, after all.

98
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,959
If you wish,

99
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:44,120
I wouldn't refuse.

100
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:49,160
We're only allies.

101
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:50,920
Don't debase yourself.

102
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,199
(Yunting Qinyue)

103
00:06:05,199 --> 00:06:07,560
Madam, please take pity on me.

104
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,079
You're neither wife nor concubine.

105
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,879
Why come begging to me?

106
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:14,439
Madam.

107
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:17,680
Young General never looks at Wan'er.

108
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:19,560
(Wan'er, Cheng Mingzhi's concubine)
Now that the Young Madam's here,

109
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:23,879
there may be no place left for me here.

110
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,279
And so?

111
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,519
So...

112
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,879
I'll watch the east courtyard for you.

113
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:32,759
At the slightest movement,

114
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:34,319
I'll report it to you first.

115
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,399
All I seek

116
00:06:37,279 --> 00:06:39,160
is your aid to

117
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:42,519
secure my place at Young General's side.

118
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:44,240
Cheng Mingzhi won't want you.

119
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:45,759
Why not come to me instead?

120
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,319
On their wedding night,

121
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,680
Cheng Mingzhi went to his study instead.

122
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:00,560
That's right.

123
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:01,560
They didn't consummate it?

124
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,839
Absolutely certain.

125
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,160
Wan'er.

126
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,480
Don't you want a proper title?

127
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:10,120
I can help you.

128
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:14,120
I'd serve you with my life, Madam.

129
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:21,759
Tonight, seduce Cheng Mingzhi
in his study.

130
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,480
This is a love draught.

131
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,000
Thank you, Madam.

132
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:42,360
Xiao.

133
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,720
Go to the bridal chamber.

134
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,800
Mother.

135
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,199
You want me to go there?

136
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,160
That's right.

137
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,800
But don't force yourself on her.

138
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,639
Make her come to you.

139
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,560
She's blind.

140
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:55,279
As long as you don't speak,

141
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:56,920
she won't know who you are.

142
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:59,439
Once the deed is done,

143
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:01,279
who's to say you forced her?

144
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:03,160
There won't even be a mark on her.

145
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:04,759
Then...

146
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:07,040
The whole house will know

147
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:10,439
the young madam was so lonely
on her wedding night

148
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:12,160
that she seduced her brother-in-law.

149
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:16,720
That charge could kill her
ten times over.

150
00:08:28,199 --> 00:08:29,480
As you command, Mother.

151
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,360
Qiuyue.

152
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,159
Madam.

153
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,679
Guard the door later.

154
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:37,320
Stay sharp.

155
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,559
Yes.

156
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,519
General.

157
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,440
Only three people knew

158
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,480
the ambush route that day.

159
00:08:53,559 --> 00:08:53,879
You,

160
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:54,279
me,

161
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:55,799
and your father, General Cheng.

162
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:56,639
(Qin Jun, Cheng Mingzhi's
personal guard)

163
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:59,120
Good thing
you changed the route that day.

164
00:08:59,120 --> 00:08:59,600
Otherwise...

165
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,879
Otherwise we'd be corpses by now.

166
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,000
I found out that

167
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:04,120
on the day of the ambush,

168
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:06,679
an urgent secret letter
was sent to the capital.

169
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:07,879
The letter...

170
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,919
It came from the Cheng Residence.

171
00:09:10,919 --> 00:09:11,720
Who sent it?

172
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,639
The messenger was killed en route.

173
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,200
The letter's missing, too.

174
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,120
(The traitor's inside
the Cheng Residence.)

175
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,440
(Grandmother is in seclusion.)

176
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,159
(Those with access
to military reports...)

177
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:24,200
(Everyone in the Cheng family
is a suspect.)

178
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,559
Keep an eye on the Xia family.

179
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:28,799
The Xia family?

180
00:09:28,799 --> 00:09:31,840
Their marriage alliance
came at a suspicious time.

181
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:34,320
They have Xia Zhengchun.

182
00:09:34,399 --> 00:09:35,519
He's Director of the Ministry of War.

183
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:38,039
He has access to
frontier military reports.

184
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,039
Yes.

185
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,039
General.

186
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:54,360
You fought bravely on the battlefield.

187
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,480
It must be exhausting.

188
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:57,759
I made you ginseng soup.

189
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,759
Put it down.

190
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,000
Get out.

191
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:11,759
General.

192
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:13,679
I have something to tell you.

193
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,000
Speak.

194
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,440
Tonight,

195
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:21,360
Second Madam is sending
Cheng Xiao to the bride's room.

196
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,960
She told Qiuyue to guard the door.

197
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,080
Once it's done,

198
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,279
they'll rush in with others.

199
00:10:26,639 --> 00:10:28,080
Aren't you afraid

200
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,240
Second Madam will find out
you're leaking?

201
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,519
General.

202
00:10:36,399 --> 00:10:39,879
Though Second Madam
sent me to your side,

203
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:42,360
I know very well

204
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,240
who my true master is.

205
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,120
Five years by your side,

206
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:51,679
and you've never once looked at me.

207
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:53,480
I don't resent it.

208
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:58,000
But I won't let others
bring you disgrace.

209
00:10:58,759 --> 00:11:00,399
So this is your show of loyalty?

210
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,960
I wouldn't dare.

211
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,480
I...

212
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:07,240
I just want a way to survive.

213
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,639
Second Madam promised me

214
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,480
that if I drove the young madam out,

215
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:22,039
she'd make me your principal wife.

216
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,240
But I know

217
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,679
she was lying to me.

218
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:29,039
Then what do you want?

219
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,240
I...

220
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:35,120
I want to stay by your side.

221
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,759
Not as Second Madam's pawn.

222
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,679
I want to be yours, Young General.

223
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:50,879
I accept your loyalty.

224
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,600
Go back and tell Second Madam

225
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,639
you've successfully gained my trust.

226
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:58,480
I drank your soup,

227
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:00,720
and I've softened toward you.

228
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,240
As for the rest,

229
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,639
you know what to say.

230
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,279
Yes.

231
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:20,720
(This is a love draught.)

232
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:33,919
I don't drink ginseng soup.

233
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,159
Don't make it again.

234
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,519
Yes.

235
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:26,800
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

236
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:32,880
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

237
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:37,280
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

238
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:40,560
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

239
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:46,680
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

240
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:53,280
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

241
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,640
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

242
00:13:57,240 --> 00:14:00,000
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

243
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:03,000
♪Cutting through old years♪

244
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:04,720
♪We can never embrace again♪

245
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:09,800
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

246
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,800
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

247
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:14,720
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

248
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,560
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

249
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,280
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

250
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:21,800
♪Too late to pull away♪

251
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,200
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

252
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:28,360
♪Now we must part♪

253
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:31,960
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

254
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:35,360
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

255
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,680
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

256
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:42,600
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
